    aiContent: {
      difficulty: 'Intermediate',
      considerations: [
        'Win the pot by having the best five-card hand at showdown, or by being the last player remaining after all others fold.',
        "After the deal, a betting round begins (player to dealer's left acts first). Players may check, bet, call, raise, or fold. Action proceeds clockwise. When the betting round ends with more than one player remaining, showdown occurs: players reveal their hands and the highest hand according to standard poker hand rankings wins the pot. Psycho Poker may add psychological or unusual rule twists per house rules.",
        'Standard poker hand rankings (high): straight flush, four of a kind, full house, flush, straight, three of a kind, two pair, one pair, high card.',
        'Five cards per player.',
      ],
