            'Betting round before showdown.',
            'Bluffing and folding are allowed.',
          ],
          hasPlaceholders: false,
        },
        strategy: {
          basic: "Play tight and value strong hands; fold weak hands. Position matters: acting later allows you to see others' actions first.",
          intermediate: 'Use bluffing sparingly; balance your range so opponents cannot read you. Consider pot odds when calling or raising.',
          advanced: "Adjust to opponents' tendencies and table dynamics; exploit predictable players. Psychological reads matter in home-game variants.",
